    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so permanent. like there is no way to undo what happened. i see them all laughing and talking in the halls and it’s like i’m watching a movie of a life i don't belong to anymore. what's the point of even trying to \"be present\" if everyone has already decided i dont exist?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
