      "content": "It's a heavy weight to feel like you're permanently erased, and that feeling is completely valid. When the world keeps moving on, it can feel like you're stuck in a loop of irrelevance. Instead of trying to force yourself into their movie, maybe you could find a quiet, private way to make your own scene—a small, deliberate act that proves you *are* here, even if no one else notices right now.",
      "source": "target",
